      "page_title": "Shared State: Silent Races & Locks",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. Mistakes: Silent Races",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "python",
          "lines": [
            "import dis",
            "dis.dis('counter += 1')",
            "# LOAD_NAME   counter",
            "# LOAD_CONST  1",
            "# BINARY_OP   +=  <- switch!",
            "# STORE_NAME  counter"
          ],
          "note": "a switch mid-way loses an update"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`counter += 1` = load, add, store: **not** atomic",
            "The ==GIL== guards the interpreter, not __your invariants__",
            "Check-then-act `if k not in d: d[k]=…` races, GIL or not",
            "Child mutates a global → parent **never** sees it (separate memory)"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "python",
          "lines": [
            "async def get(k):",
            "    if k not in cache:",
            "        # await = switch point",
            "        cache[k] = await fetch(k)",
            "    return cache[k]"
          ],
          "note": "two tasks both miss → fetch twice"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. Mechanism: Locks",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "python",
          "lines": [
            "lock = threading.Lock()",
            "with lock:        # released",
            "    counter += 1  # even on raise",
            "r = threading.RLock()",
            "with r:",
            "    with r: ...   # same thread OK"
          ],
          "note": "plain Lock re-acquired = self-deadlock"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Step",
            "Thread A",
            "Thread B"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "1",
              "acquire L1",
              "acquire L2"
            ],
            [
              "2",
              "wait L2",
              "wait L1"
            ],
            [
              "3",
              "==stuck==",
              "==stuck=="
            ],
            [
              "fix",
              "L1 → L2",
              "L1 → L2"
            ]
          ],
          "highlightRow": 2,
          "frame": "dashed"
        },
        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "Deadlock fixes",
          "items": [
